SDL-E1042 (spec/access.md)

  x invalid access issuer: issuer algorithm `HS256` must equal the verification algorithm `ES256` when verifying by local key
   ,----
 1 | access api_jwks { on: root; type: jwt; algorithm: es256; key: 'k'; issuer { algorithm: hs256; key: 's'; }; };
   :                                                                       ^^^|^^
   :                                                                          `-- this issuer block is invalid
   `----
  help: by local key the issuer must restate the verification algorithm and its own `key:` — without a key SurrealDB materializes a random one
